\par\b\fs28 \u167?7 Podcast rendering\b0\fs24\par


\par One physical image carries the landing: the field that cannot compel rain. The farmer can plough, sow, fertilise \u8212? but he cannot command the sky; the rain comes toward him. So is the Word: gift, not production. And the second half of the image: what grows on your field, you hand out \u8212? the fruit of received rain is not a store to lock away but a harvest to pass on.\par



